  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>::boot sequence::_allocatetostartup_100</em><br>\n<strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Silvermind.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain a +2 bonus to initiative checks.</p>\n<p>If your host gizmo is not a <em>mechanoid</em>, you may use your highest mental ability score modifier instead of your Dexterity modifier to determine your initiative bonus.</p>\n<p><strong>Special</strong>: This feat counts as possessing Improved Initiative for the purposes of meeting prerequisites, as well as other abilities and effects.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/silvermind#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
